tom goodman wrote:

> Q. What combination of armour and protective devices do people consider 
> optimal for this character with the above weapon options ? I'm using 
> GDSM and amulet of reflection + robe of protection.

Oops, stupid enter key at the wrong time.

Non-spellcasting outfit:
Shield of Reflection
Gauntlets of Power
GDSM
Cloak of Protection or Oilskin
AoLS
Helm of Telepathy


Spellcasting outfit:
Wooden shield (barely hinders spellcasting for V in my experience)
Gauntlets of dexterity
SDSM
AoLS
Robe
Helm of Brilliance
Eye of the Aethiopica (carried, not worn)


If you haven't got the eye of the aethiopica or some other artifact that 
confers magic resistance, it's tough to get MR, reflection, AoLS and still 
cast spells.  If it's late in the game and there are lots of artifacts in 
existence you might be out of luck.  Of course you could get an amulet of 
reflection and GDSM and live on the edge...

